{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0053_1000_p", "source_sha256": "db8a4fb694ec9e2cee794f3c96cf81f1bc1d1de9ba5c306905016913527cfa93", "ja": "（百合子が出演した『魔法少女トゥインクルリズム』の\nDVDの宣伝も兼ねた、ラジオ番組出演が決まった）", "zh": "（为了宣传百合子参与演出的『魔法少女闪亮节奏』\n的DVD，她准备要上广播节目了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0053_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "f57e7ed2e2a53d1da433943dd508c6b4ed156d2aac4825d5cd02cec73e3a9764", "ja": "あの～、すみません……\n{$P$}さん、ちょっとご相談が……！", "zh": "那个～不好意思……\n{$P$}先生，我想跟你商量一下……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0053_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ae6b195b80e8de8473a9ebc8f3d0187314fcd2bf9002bd57acf8e977803b262c", "ja": "ん？　百合子、どうした？", "zh": "嗯？百合子，怎么啦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0053_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "e76b630efa8152767334a10fd4481a399af3bbbffac206d0fb2ef1cc3feabdd9", "ja": "途中でパーソナリティさんから、好きなシーンについて\n質問があるそうなんですけど……わ、私……。", "zh": "他们说主持人会在节目中\n问我喜欢哪一段剧情……可、可是我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0053_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "9da379d749a15b9cd26e522d0e02b51d9997d67ab25b681357a46b9da892a380", "ja": "何て答えたらいいか、全然わからないんです！", "zh": "我完全不知道该回答哪一段！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0053_1005_p", "source_sha256": "66a54756d79f99379e9763a6b8f81991d757126458ff622f307e07f1eb935714", "ja": "え……あんなに楽しそうだったのに？", "zh": "什么……但你不是拍得很开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0053_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "c19bca0ac425a10a70b84891560f109f67a0994769435ce70812689936a5eb67", "ja": "そう、楽しすぎたのが問題なんです……\n全部のシーンに思い入れがあって、しぼれないんです！", "zh": "没错，问题就在于我太乐在其中了……\n每个剧情我都放了很多感情，难以抉择！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0053_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2654e50c8fec3f32185c4b6a22f32dbbd7a109f8adefaca9f0f4244479da1044", "ja": "ああ……。", "zh": "这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0053_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "db1f258475f334f182fa7800645d508c446b8a02a1b7130762d6c3791a62453c", "ja": "前半は、育ちゃんとぴーちゃんが出会うところです！\n普通の女の子が魔法少女に選ばれる、必見のシーン！", "zh": "前半是小育和小哔相遇那边！\n普通的女孩子被选为魔法少女，这一段必看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0053_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "88aa2a92b9ddb98da4df8ce384c518e911c82e711c72b8183f6cf3861eda5628", "ja": "亜利沙さんが必死に時間を稼ぐシーンもかっこいいし、\n最後の力を合わせて必殺技を撃つところなんか……！", "zh": "亚利沙拚命争取时间的桥段也很帅气，\n还有最后大家合力放出必杀技那边……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0053_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b386dd9134dddbc6bb4ae26b8ce2cad1f5017f7726aa7c7d5d1c43685e0e2a9f", "ja": "ストップストップ！　なるほど、よくわかったよ。", "zh": "停停停！原来如此，我懂了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0053_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "790a0952254f8daa09cefa0dd436a5c5a222dade97f09625a9a2bb1ea2102531", "ja": "あっ！　す、すみません……\nやっぱり私、喋らない方がいいですよね？　うう……", "zh": "啊！不、不好意思……\n我是不是不要讲比较好呢？呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0053_1012_p", "source_sha256": "2a811ed37d973902e7ca53c7c8996d7208c287d581bdc5bc8c809572bba8bd49", "ja": "いや、そのまま喋っちゃっていいんじゃないかな？", "zh": "不，我觉得你直接讲出来也没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0053_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0053_1014_p", "source_sha256": "efe59b30c70edda242925d03f51262a023d422184dbd71845b56c22db3733d6a", "ja": "出演してる人がどれだけ作品を愛しているか、\nしっかり伝わりそうだから。それが一番の宣伝だ。", "zh": "这样应该能让人体会演员有多么喜爱这个作品，\n这是最棒的宣传。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0053_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "aca7aa9382ba5b6bb4013d0531b14fdeb1e7e024a389ee3f4958644f29c8bc63", "ja": "で、でも、番組の尺とかありますよね？\nMCさんにご迷惑なんじゃ……？", "zh": "可、可是，节目的时间有限呀。\n这样会造成主持人困扰吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0053_1016_p", "source_sha256": "002e449d764621c4f965528fbf282de75c38a2a2bdb9d75556eaf1ef069df848", "ja": "大丈夫、ちゃんと止めてくれるから。\n今も俺が止めただろ？", "zh": "放心，主持人会适时制止你的，\n像我刚刚也制止了你，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0053_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "20a4f66054146f012c990c1e2e0f144d4c7c920c09b648ee4b591c9e9b389124", "ja": "あっ！　そうですね……わかりました！", "zh": "啊！说得也是……我知道了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0053_1018_026yur", "source_sha256": "3421296147b50a5308fe8bb55b6500aff077f04761bac3962d9ece170ccc514b", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}さん！\n私、遠慮しないでどんどんお話してきますね！", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}先生！\n那我就毫不保留地一吐为快吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0053_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "4790767210be31ee9128040748bc0b8a384b0a7ffef92f45d1912f9d34b13dcc", "ja": "そうだ、亜利沙さんの過去エピソードも見逃せません！\nシースー団に写真を踏みにじられた亜利沙さんの目が！", "zh": "对了，亚利沙过去的故事那段也不容错过！\n当照片被司寿团踩在地上时，亚利沙的眼神！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0053_1020_p", "source_sha256": "19ad614b8abae97c6fb28a15faed4d0d32ea3a5054874cd58c1eb06593851283", "ja": "（あれ？　止めたつもりだったんだが……\n止まってないな？）", "zh": "（奇怪？我刚刚应该制止她了才对……\n但她好像不想停？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
